
Pkg
---

.. ada:set_package:: Pkg


.. ada:type:: type Message_T
    :package: Pkg

    :spark_mode: ``Off``


    :discriminant Standard.Integer Kind:
    :variant_part: case Kind is
        :variant: when 0 => Length, Data
        :variant: when 1 | 2 => Width, Height
        :variant: when others => Raw
        end case

    Multi-variant: three when clauses, including 1 | 2.
